            <p>Most orders dispatch within 24 to 72 hours of payment confirmation. Transit time runs 3 to 7 business days to North America, Europe, and the major mining jurisdictions. We share the tracking number the moment the airwaybill is issued.</p>

            <h3>Warranty &amp; returns</h3>
            <p>Every unit carries a <strong>60-day warranty</strong> from the date you receive it. Manufacturer warranties (typically 180 to 365 days depending on the brand) run in parallel and we'll help you process those claims directly with Bitmain, MicroBT, Canaan, Goldshell, IceRiver, or Elphapex.</p>
            <p>If your unit arrives <strong>dead-on-arrival</strong> (won't power on, fails the initial hashrate test, or has visible transit damage), we replace it. Document the issue within 72 hours of delivery (a short video or photo set is enough), and we'll ship the replacement.</p>

